---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Page not found — Pokkie"><main class="not-found"><span class="mark">P</span><span class="eyebrow">404 / wrong turn</span><h1>That page has gone off-piste.</h1><p>The link may be old, or the page may never have existed. Either way, there&apos;s a lovely profile card waiting back home.</p><a href="/">Back to Pokkie <span>↗</span></a></main></Layout>
<style>.not-found{min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-content:center;justify-items:start;gap:20px;width:min(620px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}.mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--mint);font:500 24px 'DM Mono',monospace;transform:rotate(-7deg)}.eyebrow{margin-top:35px}.not-found h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem);letter-spacing:-.09em;line-height:.92}.not-found p{max-width:470px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem}.not-found a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:15px 21px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);font-weight:800;box-shadow:0 12px 24px rgba(40,29,39,.15);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}.not-found a:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 18px 30px rgba(255,23,111,.25)}.not-found a span{color:var(--pink);margin-left:0}</style>
